{"id": "86266", "name": "Function_Minimum_1", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Find the {{CT:0}}-value at which the function</p>\n<p>\\[f({{CT:1}})={{CT:2}},\\]</p>\n<p>has its minimum.</p>\n<p>The function has a minimum at \\( x = \\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>To find the \\({{CT:1}}\\)-value at which the function \\(f({{CT:1}})={{CT:2}}\\), has turning points, differentiate and find the values of \\({{CT:1}}\\) for which the differential is equal to 0.</p>\n<p><br /> \\[\\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{d{{CT:1}}}\\left({{CT:2}}\\right) &amp;=&amp; {{CT:3}} \\\\ {{CT:3}} &amp; =&amp; 0 \\\\ {{CT:4}}&amp;=&amp; 0 \\end{array}\\]</p>\n<p>which factorises to give</p>\n<p>\\[{{CT:1}} = {{CT:5}}  \\mbox{ and }  {{CT:1}} = -10\\]</p>\n<p>A turning point is a minimum if \\(\\frac{d^2}{d{{CT:1}}^2}\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)\\)&gt;0.</p>\n<p>\\[\\frac{d^2}{d{{CT:1}}^2}\\left({{CT:2}}\\right) = {{CT:6}}\\]</p>\n<p>This is positive for \\({{CT:1}} = {{CT:5}}\\) and negative for \\({{CT:1}} = -10\\).</p>\n<p>Therefore the minimum value of the function \\(f({{CT:1}})\\) occurs at \\({{CT:1}} = {{CT:5}}\\).</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "diffdiffp", "diffp", "diffpsimp", "n1", "p", "v", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2"], "nvariants": 8}